t="epo"><addressbook><name>KATO TORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHTAWA YASUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KANEKO, YOHEI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATO, TORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHTAWA, YASUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A softening finish composition having the excellent ability to impart flexibility and having satisfactory biodegradability. The composition comprises the following ingredients (A) and (B). (A) An amine represented by general formula (I), an acid salt or quaternary compound thereof, or a mixture of these. (B) A quaternary ammonium salt represented by general formula (II).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une composition adoucissante très efficace pour assouplir, et présentant une biodégradabilité satisfaisante. Ladite composition comprend les ingrédients (A) et (B), (A) correspondant à une amine représentée par la formule générale (I), un sel ou un composé quaternaire de celle-ci, ou un mélange de ceux-ci, et (B) correspondant à un sel d'ammonium quaternaire représenté par la formule générale (II).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/